.ogg","category":"formation","text":"いち！に！いち！に！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/KEPAqQtzCcGmoxunNR5J9T8vEnOzvwcn.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ウェイトトレーニングは科学です。 ミレニアムの最先端の理論が、輝きを放つ領域なんです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/SG8q8Oj7SG3Ee5pbE2IISBHglw8Gppah.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"トレーニングは辛いですが、 この瞬間のためなら耐えられます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/4yk4LpSAWBOBGQyzVHxRwql9gmkiL0Ll.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"もっと素敵な自分になりたいです…。 トレーナーと一緒に。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/2qjybRWM85VbzlXtcVG7XwG7qoKrlwzt.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"トレーナーも一緒に運動しましょう？ 運動は本当にいいこと尽くめです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/ivg8n8N4eBR2a9WgYiXqta36MIoa3j1z.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"今日も…、ありがとうございます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/YSpJ6Z2USgRNAOGFacfa0hbdDBEdtVe7.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"視点が変わると、世界が変わって見えます。 階段だって立派な運動器具です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/98wGe5VMADVTHKl9bc5Fhz0genmPo8Sz.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"それではまず、ロードワークから始めましょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/jWWLRtM1xXsJxccKKiaBUSsiTriM3bQK.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"はい？なぜ制服ではないのか、ですか？ トレーニングするのに不便だからです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/wRYJRmJBHzMOiJ1XV1WhFO2JNe0xGtiy.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"最近生徒の間では筋トレが流行っているんですよ。 …はい、すみません。私の妄想です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/DFT43Ki7CotUxn9vqFubZg56EkYd2Yyp.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"太ももは第2の心臓と呼ばれています。 しっかり鍛錬しないといけません。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/yXaumUJQX55MPUNyoucN4G2ChxyVjbru.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"おかえりなさい、トレーナー。 今日も一緒に頑張りましょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/uIkMckP35avpjQ9mnurfKr7YhpKGsURS.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お待ちしておりました。 それではトレーニングを始めましょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/MiW9u67iNhi77RkUtLoV0BFtMf3uNMWD.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_0.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"はあ......はあ....あ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/pvM3uROGJYtTWxr7LlQNDG9kPB8YUzLT.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"どうですかトレーナー、運動は、楽しいでしょう？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/J8vghBDafRGPoldzLKzWuviJodE2nNRG.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"健康になる感じが、しませんか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/skso3BbMGafwZvEb1nHMBXaHPBpHNVzD.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あ、えっと… あ、あまり見つめないでください。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/IJxtke6hMI59SRIPWgIVj1sIR1yYJDfv.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"(トレーニング中はひどい見た目だし…)","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/F9CjLE4VkJ62Gi4dbJ2tgheB9rNxP18Z.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ど、どこを見てるんですか…？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/4V9lN6XxrA4MNvLKSZhFbgN1zwueTmUy.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"…トレーナー、お願いがあります。 これからも、ずっと一緒に運動をしましょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/JnoJyBzoWf8o2bLWSCwuhAq7dJQqjqcm.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"私はトレーナーが健康でいてほしいです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/cbPYU2I8pnLvBWRYcU4AwEynB1CQTQSX.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"り、理由ですか？ そ、それは…。 ふふっ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/flgqfxFlkZRKyVWig3lnUqMFbTXvGfFn.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_MemorialLobby_5_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"当ててみてください。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/Nt81mTpovBKQRhQGi1AgHjjRXTU240wj.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"トレーナーに会うたびに胸が苦しくなります…。どうしてでしょうか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/X9BC0TwjJBXedr21M8MVZiDZYcG5KLRR.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"トレーナー。私と腕相撲してみませんか？ け、決してトレーナーと手をつなぎたくて…という訳では……ありません…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/OGK77FdsFPmIEEwNF8lzF4275vgYLBg1.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"トレーナーと一緒にいると、心拍数が増加します…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/w3ZFTVUgc4PqgSyH1ck0ptqqdFM2pw4r.ogg"},{"description":"Sumire_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","t