TjbsQfJxxg6NkeEB09.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_battle_shout_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"哈！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/yMZB1UVW1hYf3p4bJV7fgJH4ZNKMnsas.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_battle_shout_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"一！二！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/3eZAOdZo7eL4PAV8rmT10oz00P6hz6Se.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_battle_shout_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"呀——","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/kiHTYbNdz4yZD7riADa20O0duU8KuW6M.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_battle_tacticalaction_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"前进！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/YqNU5AYkDNOQElSoqsT0TOjhPksWtTwA.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_battle_victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"（喝水）啊！请，请别一直看着我......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/XVQdK3S884WjA0QQPTfOzXt4iSmvgjJv.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_battle_victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"（喝水）您，您辛苦了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/f5y4bYXzxWMyPG8eFVvW7USOg3iJpY1w.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_cafe_act_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"欸？想一起做拉伸是吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/JOtJndhO0liYa0uTtiFsrlECrYABsCuo.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_cafe_act_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"好，然后要一起去跑步吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/aNv8uietekpxFWt13G5DAJnuZMnDoo84.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"嘿——","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/VWlUMQpDbBG2gC00566WThaIFIhvnYjB.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"有没有能健身的地方呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/pRvVnnC9W67WShjrRdRjmEZjgWInCZOv.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"这里，好像很适合做自由重量训练啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/Yfux6QPm1ai56I0RXwzeeF8XeBjkdG39.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"教练......有件事想拜托您......我们以后，也继续一起做运动吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/Lcmup9yFFsklIa6NVduNDgxrNLRYnNyF.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"我希望教练能一直保持健康的身体。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/ausq779zlSKpgBgVpzpmLsgqyzdbPhJz.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"您，您问原因？是，是因为......哼哼......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/IoLmRonXexirwaGh13fs0VLWf9eJPeJ4.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_5_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"请您猜猜看吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/f27GKmYNerID5Gq4SrHrRGFGlzMHUuU3.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_relationship_up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"每次遇到教练，我都会感到胸口微微发痛。到底是什么原因呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/th50XbjXF74VCSMnjGXq6XXk5xw7KhfA.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_relationship_up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"教练，要不要和我掰掰手腕？啊—绝对不是因为，想摸教练的......手......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/JdPOEOji07BIxmyl3VgkM3D0bhnTJV2G.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_relationship_up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"和教练在一起，心率就会上升......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/HHBThabh5HfnISm45L3ElcW8sPEspRcB.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_relationship_up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"想，一起出出汗吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/qyy7wVbhimIpHMsLEk4Gi9VXRr5OGG7w.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_season_birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"非常感谢您送上的祝福。问我想要什么？嗯......最高级的蛋白粉！啊不对，我，我其实想要可爱的猫咪玩偶......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/pNVV9DFKTA3FhUU5XBNQcQAPsGrJYofD.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_season_birthday_player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"教练，祝您生日快乐。我准备了一份礼物。欸，您问，是不是哑铃？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/VqCVvl5XODryeJHhKCIxAAJIgsI17k1U.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_season_halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"教练，您想尝一下蛋白质糖果吗？欸，您问味道怎么样？以前，我也曾经觉得味道很重要。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/MZhSmQfLmyozMQX3c1kRlDzvdyoFG5uO.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_season_newyear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"如果要许愿的话，我希望今年一整年大家都健健康康的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/TX8KzqCAcsBkpsuZNyCsmwwm0dVbANUa.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_season_xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"听说圣诞节是某位圣人诞生的日子。虽然我不太了解那位圣人，但我想，他肯定也有一身发达的肌肉。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/w3D4LNgylcfAwm5qfSQOoADDt5MzXdEW.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_tactic_defeat_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"不好意思。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/DiFlkNpDPEQI5QIzXZlsEimzboRqFplN.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_tactic_defeat_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"真的十分抱歉，教练。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/WqQm4CCBkTShiPXSsEYCenOyJXMkppEC.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_tactic_in_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"今天的训练，是以实践的形式进行吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/Lo2lbeEVv8goemVngDPXFeqO2orWQyef.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_tactic_in_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"教练，请您多多关照。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/vIqb2DOKGwVqZLgYwgWDv5dYrzPJLiBJ.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_tactic_victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"获得成果是值得高兴的事。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/8qksmjkuWGMAKbFVIdysObzZpX4pkRHJ.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_tactic_victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"我感觉自己又变强了一个等级。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/RKVYTbw3L7WikHTQReocm4c5BKDMD2YC.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_title.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive.","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/KrOWKWaE9qC1rbaX7CRsoq49UEYlTTfs.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"呼......准备好了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/VF2LeEKEz4VcdRtMBqYMHD7zWsRAwgeq.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"呼......出发！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/K8Aam6oJDZMU3TyPGlhihp7yxPxINU9b.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"一！二！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/5QCAzh9pocFqSvNHbNQDo36JpzlSlnX8.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"哼！哈！嘿！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/18pwD690CrjAToFCf6eXoTmvWkFemfrR.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"哈！呀！我要上了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/cPfhvAIWzNMjDljTX5KAZcNiJZrbLp69.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"能够操作这样的装备，也是健身的成果，但我不会满足于现状。教练，我会继续努力的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/PXUDZrsiCwD6xxpQzMexWRBvXMgUmnCI.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"开始健身吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/5SrU1Xyn0G3vkXscRdE2Hlz1cPoxtSfn.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"我会听从教练的指示。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/8NZBuwC2hSFeyQlQOz0FYkHSeSfDi6Wy.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"一，二，一，二。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/VATY8Rfo0ZNMzzpDE7XyTOS4y1GSiotU.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"负重训练是一种科学，是千禧年的尖端理论展现光芒的领域。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/lNkji5l03Vf7FRNOcooRQvF7WCIzDPDU.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"虽然健身很辛苦，但是为了这一刻，我可以忍耐。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/U8fgTJqPUy6LsLvIHKn2hoSytSUZOQZv.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"我想让自己变得更好......和教练一起。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/sfUGmBYVz4nhtZPpEg4zyIESKJ065C79.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"教练也一起来运动吧！运动真的太有益处了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/YbArYMrpFjBaI4sGKR0VELOpOd9dZNLg.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"今天，也非常感谢您！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/1HZu1jukuGoYeCKFHfWztXfIn2cuvzZ2.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"看待事物的角度不同，看到的世界也会不同。楼梯也可以是非常优秀的运动器材。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/h3U0MCVHAIj5vrW1M2Etdi0iXgdBk0Wi.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"那么我们就先从慢跑开始吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/OLdZTx7wLiTqaW5U5EPbNBoh5SYjTFnf.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"什么？您问我为什么不穿制服？因为健身的时候很不方便啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/wv6c8ViI4mrag3aCcKhj70ZEeAKGq3QK.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"最近基沃托斯很流行力量训练呢。额......是的，对不起，这是我的幻想......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/IXBuwiY1rEKlODEsDJ2oLc5XaZXBqNL9.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"大腿也被叫做第二个心脏，所以必须重视腿部训练。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/mQ31hk4KKdfplv2UsimNYndYginnDlrT.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"您回来啦，教练。今天也一起加油吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/CiwahZ6QxQ5KaztGk4Pb3NOHorMBzvdk.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"等您很久了，那我们开始锻炼吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/VxzKmVzD9msCEiIsWxl2An4sTZY14HPH.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_0","category":"lobby","text":"呼......呼......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/Vklzy0WETXtlEYZN1CmBSiXUINjcmSkm.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"您感觉怎么样，教练......（喘气）运动，是不是很快乐？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/be6ng7CiHX5ntJhqq1gEJ3GOQP9VoAyk.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"您有没有感觉，变得更健康了？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/OKmle6tl5ocv2zw78xrHxN99Syn3iy7q.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，啊......请，请您别一直盯着我看嘛......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/0yiT1YMst9C9eg58sINZrhm1kibbTbg8.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"（训练的时候，样子可不好看......）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/MWLnB0Ia2IM1nnpvS85i4E4N5PexpA47.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"您，您这是在看什么地方呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/EwsR8fJoHnzwWAC8dG6Ed1PxGU6vifx9.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"锁定！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/Dckt6bC12VQdVqColzZtfUfxJhjun97Y.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"好，我们走吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/9jsWFVhuJMbF8iDMgPqD6WpWmgxoN0Uu.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"这块月饼，热量一定很高吧……但今天又是难得的节日……教练，吃完就请您陪我一起加练啦！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/AChCzAY7zUP69PB3sccjddT1QgHoMnkG.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"教练，新春快乐！新的一年里，也请一起努力锻炼吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/1PInBS18hUGVcUu9cWG0ClqUZYFWOfof.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"sumire_battle_move_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%B9%99%E8%8A%B1%20%E5%A0%87/original/sumire_battle_move_1.ogg"},{"description":"sumire_battle_move_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/stu